0f3113520bb93cdb693895ac8024302a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/df5cbe2b/uploads/origins/7e33628c-7b77-47c0-ade3-fbda56682a7d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0f3113520bb93cdb693895ac8024302a, https://si.imgix.net/df5cbe2b/uploads/origins/7e33628c-7b77-47c0-ade3-fbda56682a7d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=caa1ca272162e08fa7c34841ad00c98d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/df5cbe2b/uploads/origins/7e33628c-7b77-47c0-ade3-fbda56682a7d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=20ef31396f58cec7c81b1437ec44f66a 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは、藤凪さん。いつも素敵なイラストをありがとうございます！私のキャラクター＜グリード＞のイラストをリクエストしてもよろしいでしょうか？\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/32794094.oc-refs/33620594.greed/gallery?key=Q0Q46hKDA4y5FuX\n\nURLからお好きな衣装をお選びください。グリードとは、不思議で愛想の良い性格の魔物で、魔法の骨董屋を営んでいる。\n\nミステリアスな雰囲気で描いてもらえると嬉しいです。モルフォ蝶を持っていたり、赤いリンゴを持っていたり。あとは藤凪さんにお任せします。\n\n可能であれば、看板レイヤーをイラストとは別にしたPSDファイルを納品してください。何卒よろしくお願いいたします。", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Fujinagi/works/17", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 996914, "client_id": 211848, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8e838a30/uploads/origins/5b876023-ec7c-4d4b-9518-80fb385d3ae0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=151aa929c31715d0d26883a5d43f3dee", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8e838a30/uploads/origins/5b876023-ec7c-4d4b-9518-80fb385d3ae0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=151aa929c31715d0d26883a5d43f3dee, https://si.imgix.net/8e838a30/uploads/origins/5b876023-ec7c-4d4b-9518-80fb385d3ae0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=23ad39843e1758ab74ee5f4dc3d485f2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8e838a30/uploads/origins/5b876023-ec7c-4d4b-9518-80fb385d3ae0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0c26ae9f4c3bbc428bd8e039b5a371de 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8e838a30/uploads/origins/5b876023-ec7c-4d4b-9518-80fb385d3ae0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1571f26062be88dfe92ac3c941c937a8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8e838a30/uploads/origins/5b876023-ec7c-4d4b-9518-80fb385d3ae0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1571f26062be88dfe92ac3c941c937a8, https://si.imgix.net/8e838a30/uploads/origins/5b876023-ec7c-4d4b-9518-80fb385d3ae0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1c40239f4c6346e275967070426221fb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8e838a30/uploads/origins/5b876023-ec7c-4d4b-9518-80fb385d3ae0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c4755a31ea6fbb85f64d8d5b401ac685 3x"}, "body": "Hello again! The last work was simply exquisite, thank you again! I'm here with another request!\n\nsta.sh/0j5vxwhssn7\n\nAn eldritch creature that likes humans. She was born and Earth and was raised in isolation, but grew curious of the culture of the planet. Unable to directly interact with people, she grew attached to the web, as it let her consume human culture and talk with them through text. Wanting to further interact, she made a doll for himself, and started her own website to share all the knowledge she had accumulated to interact more with humans. It has a 90's aesthetic and grainy footage.\n\nDraw her however you want! She can't express because of her doll face, unfortunately, but she can still emote with her LED face-mask. I'd like her mask on because of that, and I leave everything else for you to decide. You can have her with her sleeves rolled up or left down, with her hood up or down, her spider legs out or not, it's totally up to you! I leave the scene and composition up to you. The kind of vibe I want is a beneficiary scholar eager to assist, but isn't aware just how terrifying they are.\n\nIf possible, please deliver a PSD file with the sign layer separate from the illustration. Thank you for your consideration, and have a lovely day!", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Fujinagi/works/16", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 996914, "client_id": 3433882, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d3fd5823/uploads/origins/483d6fd0-646c-4803-8339-103666441842?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dfe3942a268cff9a5491b32a8ab662bb", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d3fd5823/uploads/origins/483d6fd0-646c-4803-8339-103666441842?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dfe3942a268cff9a5491b32a8ab662bb, https://si.imgix.net/d3fd5823/uploads/origins/483d6fd0-646c-4803-8339-103666441842?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e2da88045bb043177df1251b9a2e6cf3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d3fd5823/uploads/origins/483d6fd0-646c-4803-8339-103666441842?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5846a42e5a3d0397bc1c54efde968fe0 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d3fd5823/uploads/origins/483d6fd0-646c-4803-8339-103666441842?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b12e56518a27973c78ef7ef7af7eb759", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d3fd5823/uploads/origins/483d6fd0-646c-4803-8339-103666441842?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b12e56518a27973c78ef7ef7af7eb759, https://si.imgix.net/d3fd5823/uploads/origins/483d6fd0-646c-4803-8339-103666441842?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b19629e0b153a30053e81d6ff67e5b3e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d3fd5823/uploads/origins/483d6fd0-646c-4803-8339-103666441842?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9012ccdede40a79077f161b5c9db520c 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは！あなたのアートスタイルはとてもクールですね！血のアートワークもとても好きです。\n\n私のキャラクターの絵をお願いしたいです：\n名前はサッカリン、かわいいヤンデレです。\n年齢は18歳で高校生です。\n背は低くて華奢だけど、体は強い。\n目は大きくて、緑色だけど、暗くて、キラキラした光は入っていない。眼鏡は大きくて丸い。\n髪は後ろの毛先をカールさせている。\n服装は制服。\n\nナイフ🔪や斧🪓、ラブレター💌などの小道具を追加することもできます。ポーズや背景・構図は自由に決めてください。顔の血飛沫も入れてください！\n\n必要であれば、下のリンクにグーグルドライブのリンクと一緒にもっと写真があります：\nhttps://toyhou.se/1332053.saccharin/gallery\n\nご検討ありがとうございます！楽しく描いていただけると嬉しいです^^💕。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1_9qOIbZxM8NhETsy1gdXhG4DVA2eVBH5", "nc": 32, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Fujinagi/works/15", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 996914, "client_id": 211848, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/28d5e636/uploads/origins/0806df51-6141-4305-8067-9c2e4896b03f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=755d5cf4964b82c437d35fa3e4cff951", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/28d5e636/uploads/origins/0806df51-6141-4305-8067-9c2e4896b03f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=755d5cf4964b82c437d35fa3e4cff951, https://si.imgix.net/28d5e636/uploads/origins/0806df51-6141-4305-8067-9c2e4896b03f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b9ee806d6d3be24ac3b13d40d5609e24 2x, https://si.imgix.net/28d5e636/uploads/origins/0806df51-6141-4305-8067-9c2e4896b03f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d50554ebcc776d8da8e0afc7f55c09df 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {