nd to fail since people lose interest in him the more he talks. He's surprised to learn this, since he considers himself a fun person.\n\nI like your lovely expressions, so I'd prefer the mask off, but you can have it in his hands or somewhere else if you'd like. I'd also like for there to be some blood splatter on his face, and other than that I leave the rest to you.\n\nThank you for your consideration!", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Fujinagi/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 996914, "client_id": 1259326, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ea088e4d/uploads/origins/0ed9c25e-7c1a-46ea-bd72-12b9bcdaac59?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=24b705f985b620ceab10822297e4fe29", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ea088e4d/uploads/origins/0ed9c25e-7c1a-46ea-bd72-12b9bcdaac59?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=24b705f985b620ceab10822297e4fe29, https://si.imgix.net/ea088e4d/uploads/origins/0ed9c25e-7c1a-46ea-bd72-12b9bcdaac59?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3b305f0034749b495f9da5d8858ad439 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ea088e4d/uploads/origins/0ed9c25e-7c1a-46ea-bd72-12b9bcdaac59?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d4a3c79e1c42726f602236b3cd31529b 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/ea088e4d/uploads/origins/0ed9c25e-7c1a-46ea-bd72-12b9bcdaac59?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=78b452ec9a2c1b5826500e915a80ff60", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ea088e4d/uploads/origins/0ed9c25e-7c1a-46ea-bd72-12b9bcdaac59?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=78b452ec9a2c1b5826500e